---
layout: themes/stage/base.njk
permalink: /demo/stage/
title: 陳以築 — 職涯策略顧問
seoTitle: 展示架構示範 · 舞台系 Stage
description: 個人策展服務的展示架構示範 — 舞台系,適合講師、顧問、知識型創作者。
heroBand: true
---
<div class="hero-band">
  <div class="wrap">
    <header class="site-header">
      <a class="brand" href="{{ home }}">{{ p.name }}</a>
      <nav>{% for item in p.nav %}<a href="{{ item.href }}">{{ item.label }}</a>{% endfor %}</nav>
    </header>

    <section class="hero">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">{{ p.eyebrow }}</p>
        <h1>{{ p.headline }}</h1>
        <p class="lead">{{ p.sub }}</p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a class="btn btn-brass" href="mailto:{{ p.contact.email }}">邀約演講</a>
          <a class="btn btn-line" href="/demo/stage/service/positioning/">一對一諮詢</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="portrait">
        <div class="frame">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 200 250" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMax slice" aria-hidden="true">
            <circle cx="100" cy="92" r="44" fill="#1d3a34" opacity=".92"/>
            <path d="M28 250 C30 178 70 156 100 156 C130 156 170 178 172 250 Z" fill="#1d3a34" opacity=".92"/>
          </svg>
          <span class="credential">{{ p.credential }}</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</div>

<main id="main">
  <div class="clients">
    <div class="wrap">
      <span class="lead-in">合作過</span>
      {%- for c in p.clients %}<b>{{ c }}</b>{% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="wrap">
    <section class="section" id="talks">
      <p class="label">Featured Talk</p>
      <h2>精選演講</h2>
      <a class="video" href="/demo/stage/talk/resume-as-argument/">
        <span class="play"><i></i></span>
        <span class="caption">{{ p.featuredTalk.title }} — {{ p.featuredTalk.meta }}</span>
      </a>
    </section>

    <section class="section" id="quotes">
      <p class="label">Testimonials</p>
      <h2>他們怎麼說</h2>
      <div class="quotes">
        {%- for q in p.quotes %}
        <blockquote class="quote">
          <p>「{{ q.text }}」</p>
          <footer>{{ q.by }}</footer>
        </blockquote>
        {%- endfor %}
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <p class="label">Topics</p>
      <h2>三個常備主題</h2>
      <div class="topics">
        <a class="topic" href="/demo/stage/talk/resume-as-argument/">
          <span class="no">01</span>
          <h3>職涯敘事力</h3>
          <p>把履歷從清單變成論證:一條主線,三個證據,一句記憶點。</p>
        </a>
        <a class="topic" href="/demo/stage/service/positioning/">
          <span class="no">02</span>
          <h3>轉職定位工作坊</h3>
          <p>用四個訪談問題,找出你下一步真正能贏的位置。</p>
        </a>
        <a class="topic" href="/demo/stage/talk/resume-as-argument/">
          <span class="no">03</span>
          <h3>團隊價值溝通</h3>
          <p>讓技術團隊把「我們在做什麼」講給預算決策者聽懂。</p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" id="writing">
      <p class="label">Writing</p>
      <h2>最近的文章</h2>
      <div class="article-list">
        {%- for a in p.articles %}
        <a class="article-item" href="#">
          <time>{{ a.date | isoDate }}</time>
          <span><b>{{ a.title }}</b><span class="src">{{ a.source }}</span></span>
        </a>
        {%- endfor %}
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="page-cta" id="contact">
      <h2>{{ p.contact.heading }}</h2>
      <p>邀約與諮詢:{{ p.contact.email }} · {{ p.contact.note }}</p>
      <a class="btn btn-brass" href="mailto:{{ p.contact.email }}">{{ p.contact.cta }}</a>
    </section>
  </div>
</main>
